.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH signstar-sign 1  "signstar-sign " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
signstar\-sign \- Sign a signing request and return it as structured data.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsignstar\-sign\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Sign a signing request and return it as structured data.
.PP
Signing requests, following the request specification, are accepted on `stdin`:
https://signstar.archlinux.page/signstar\-request\-signature/request.html
.PP
The signature is returned on `stdout`, in accordance with the response specification:
https://signstar.archlinux.page/signstar\-request\-signature/response.html
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Increase logging verbosity
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Decrease logging verbosity
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
